                      "id": "data-engineering-ai-ch1-sub3",
                      "slug": "prinsip-transaksional-acid-atomicity-consistency-isolation-durability",
                      "title": "1.3. Prinsip Transaksional ACID (Atomicity, Consistency, Isolation, Durability)",
                      "orderIndex": 3,
                      "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Prinsip Transaksional ACID (Atomicity, Consistency, Isolation, Durability): formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
                      "learningObjectives": [
                            "Menganalisis empat pilar jaminan transaksional ACID pada basis data relasional dan platform data modern.",
                            "Memahami mekanisme isolasi transaksi (Read Uncommitted, Read Committed, Repeatable Read, Serializable) dan fenomena anomali baca.",
                            "Mengimplementasikan simulasi manajer transaksi mini dengan Write-Ahead Logging (WAL) dan rollback atomik."
                      ],
