                      "orderIndex": 4,
                      "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Prinsip Sistem Terdistribusi BASE (Basically Available, Soft state, Eventual consistency): formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
