                                  "expectedOutput": "Simulasi Replikasi Bertahap (Eventual Consistency):\n  Putaran 0 (Pasca Penulisan Node 0): Status Konvergen = False | Nilai Node: [['item_laptop'], None, None, None]\n  Putaran 1 (Gossip Sync Replikasi) : Status Konvergen = True | Nilai Node: [['item_laptop'], ['item_laptop'], ['item_laptop'], ['item_laptop']]\n  Putaran 2 (Gossip Sync Replikasi) : Status Konvergen = True | Nilai Node: [['item_laptop'], ['item_laptop'], ['item_laptop'], ['item_laptop']]\n  Putaran 3 (Gossip Sync Replikasi) : Status Konvergen = True | Nilai Node: [['item_laptop'], ['item_laptop'], ['item_laptop'], ['item_laptop']]\n  Status Akhir: Seluruh 4 Node Berhasil Konvergen Sempurna (Eventual Consistency Terbukti!)",
