                                  "filename": "karakteristik-beban-kerja-olap-online-analytical-processing.py",
                                  "code": "import time\nimport numpy as np\n\n# Simulasi Beban Kerja OLAP: Kueri Agregasi Multi-Dimensi (Group-By) Skala Besar\nclass SimulatedOLAPEngine:\n    def __init__(self, n_rows=1_000_000):\n        np.random.seed(42)\n        # Penyimpanan berorientasi kolom (Columnar arrays)\n        self.category_column = np.random.choice([\"Elektronik\", \"Pakaian\", \"Makanan\", \"Otomotif\"], size=n_rows)\n        self.revenue_column = np.random.exponential(scale=150.0, size=n_rows).astype(np.float32)\n        self.n = n_rows\n\n    def execute_vectorized_aggregation(self):\n        # Kueri: SELECT category, SUM(revenue), COUNT(*) GROUP BY category\n        t0 = time.perf_counter()\n        unique_categories = np.unique(self.category_column)\n        results = {}\n        \n        for cat in unique_categories:\n            mask = (self.category_column == cat)\n            cat_rev_sum = np.sum(self.revenue_column[mask])\n            cat_count = np.sum(mask)\n            results[cat] = {\"total_revenue\": float(cat_rev_sum), \"transactions\": int(cat_count)}\n            \n        dur_ms = (time.perf_counter() - t0) * 1000\n        return results, dur_ms\n\nolap_engine = SimulatedOLAPEngine(n_rows=1_000_000)\naggs, query_time = olap_engine.execute_vectorized_aggregation()\n\nprint(f\"Evaluasi Kueri Analitik OLAP ({olap_engine.n:,} Baris Data):\")\nprint(f\"  Durasi Eksekusi Kueri : {query_time:.2f} ms (Throughput: {olap_engine.n / (query_time/1000):,.0f} baris/detik)\")\nprint(\"  Hasil Agregasi Multi-Kategori:\")\nfor cat, data in aggs.items():\n    print(f\"    - {cat:<12}: Total Pendapatan = Rp {data['total_revenue']:,.2f} ({data['transactions']:,} transaksi)\")",
                                  "expectedOutput": "Evaluasi Kueri Analitik OLAP (1,000,000 Baris Data):\n  Durasi Eksekusi Kueri : 411.66 ms (Throughput: 2,429,196 baris/detik)\n  Hasil Agregasi Multi-Kategori:\n    - Elektronik  : Total Pendapatan = Rp 37,492,416.00 (250,219 transaksi)\n    - Makanan     : Total Pendapatan = Rp 37,510,808.00 (249,970 transaksi)\n    - Otomotif    : Total Pendapatan = Rp 37,495,248.00 (250,057 transaksi)\n    - Pakaian     : Total Pendapatan = Rp 37,463,772.00 (249,754 transaksi)",
                                  "explanation": "Implementasi Python 3 teruji untuk Karakteristik Beban Kerja OLAP (Online Analytical Processing) dengan validasi komputasi dan verifikasi konsol konsisten.",
