                      "title": "5.9. Pembersihan File Kadaluwarsa (VACUUM Retention Policies & Tombstone Management)",
                      "orderIndex": 9,
                      "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Pembersihan File Kadaluwarsa (VACUUM Retention Policies & Tombstone Management): formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
