                      "title": "6.1. Arsitektur Master-Worker Apache Spark (Driver, Cluster Manager, dan Executors)",
                      "orderIndex": 1,
                      "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Arsitektur Master-Worker Apache Spark (Driver, Cluster Manager, dan Executors): formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
