                      "id": "data-engineering-ai-ch6-sub2",
                      "slug": "resilient-distributed-datasets-rdd-zaharia-et-al-nsdi-2012",
                      "title": "6.2. Resilient Distributed Datasets (RDD - Zaharia et al., NSDI 2012)",
                      "orderIndex": 2,
                      "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Resilient Distributed Datasets (RDD - Zaharia et al., NSDI 2012): formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
