                      "orderIndex": 8,
                      "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Jaminan Pengiriman Pesan: At-Most-Once, At-Least-Once, dan Exactly-Once (EOS): formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
