                      "title": "11.1. Paradigma Workflow Orchestration: Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) & Dependency Resolution",
                      "orderIndex": 1,
                      "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Paradigma Workflow Orchestration: Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) & Dependency Resolution: formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
