                      "title": "12.1. Paradigma Analytics Engineering: Pemisahan Compute Ingestion vs In-Warehouse Transformation (ELT)",
                      "orderIndex": 1,
                      "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Paradigma Analytics Engineering: Pemisahan Compute Ingestion vs In-Warehouse Transformation (ELT): formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
