                                  "code": "# Simulator Kompilasi Model Inkremental dbt: Filter Window & Rekonsiliasi Merge\nclass DBTIncrementalModelSimulator:\n    def __init__(self, target_table_data=None):\n        self.target_table = target_table_data or []\n        \n    def is_incremental(self, is_full_refresh=False):\n        return len(self.target_table) > 0 and not is_full_refresh\n        \n    def compile_and_run(self, raw_source_stream, lookback_days=2, is_full_refresh=False):\n        if self.is_incremental(is_full_refresh):\n            # Hitung max event timestamp dari tabel target saat ini\n            max_existing_day = max(r['day'] for r in self.target_table)\n            filter_threshold = max_existing_day - lookback_days\n            # Filter hanya baris baru atau dalam lookback window\n            scanned_records = [r for r in raw_source_stream if r['day'] >= filter_threshold]\n            \n            # Rekonsiliasi Merge berbasis unique_key (id)\n            target_dict = {r['id']: r for r in self.target_table}\n            for record in scanned_records:\n                target_dict[record['id']] = record # Upsert mutasi terbaru\n            self.target_table = list(target_dict.values())\n            mode = f'INCREMENTAL (Pindai day >= {filter_threshold})'\n        else:\n            # Full Refresh: Tulis ulang seluruh data\n            self.target_table = list(raw_source_stream)\n            mode = 'FULL REFRESH (Rebuild Total)'\n            \n        return mode, len(self.target_table)\n\nsource_data = [\n    {'id': 1, 'day': 10, 'status': 'COMPLETED', 'amount': 150},\n    {'id': 2, 'day': 11, 'status': 'COMPLETED', 'amount': 200},\n    {'id': 3, 'day': 12, 'status': 'PENDING', 'amount': 350},\n    {'id': 3, 'day': 12, 'status': 'COMPLETED', 'amount': 350}, # Mutasi status id 3\n    {'id': 4, 'day': 13, 'status': 'COMPLETED', 'amount': 500}  # Record baru\n]\n\nmodel = DBTIncrementalModelSimulator()\n# Run 1: Inisialisasi Full Refresh\nmode1, count1 = model.compile_and_run(source_data[:3], is_full_refresh=True)\n# Run 2: Inkremental Ingesti data baru & update status\nmode2, count2 = model.compile_and_run(source_data, lookback_days=1, is_full_refresh=False)\n\nprint('Simulasi Siklus Eksekusi dbt Incremental:')\nprint(f\"  Run 1: {mode1} -> {count1} record di target\")\nprint(f\"  Run 2: {mode2} -> {count2} record di target (Status id 3 ter-update!)\")\nprint('Kesimpulan: is_incremental() mencegah scanning data historis yang tidak berubah.')",
                                  "expectedOutput": "Simulasi Siklus Eksekusi dbt Incremental:\n  Run 1: FULL REFRESH (Rebuild Total) -> 3 record di target\n  Run 2: INCREMENTAL (Pindai day >= 11) -> 4 record di target (Status id 3 ter-update!)\nKesimpulan: is_incremental() mencegah scanning data historis yang tidak berubah.",
                                  "explanation": "Implementasi Python 3 teruji untuk Logika Inkremental Lanjutan: is_incremental(), Unique Keys, & Partisi Filter dengan validasi komputasi dan verifikasi konsol konsisten.",
