                      "title": "13.1. Dimensi Kualitas Data (Completeness, Uniqueness, Timeliness, Validity, Accuracy, Consistency)",
                      "orderIndex": 1,
                      "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Dimensi Kualitas Data (Completeness, Uniqueness, Timeliness, Validity, Accuracy, Consistency): formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
