                      "orderIndex": 2,
                      "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Arsitektur Great Expectations (GX): Data Context, Data Sources, & Execution Engines (Pandas/Spark/SQL): formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
